    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Bruschette With Tomato\"\n  servings: 2\n  prep_time: \"48 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"111 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"2 pieces endive\"\n    \"1 oz peanuts\"\n    \"3 tsp maple syrup\"\n    \"1 cups barberry\"\n    \"4 tsp mace\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"Juicy crocodile, grilled to your liking and drizzled with a bold lime leaves sauce, served alongside roasted garlic.\"\n    \"A slow-roasted Downy Woodpecker with a fresh, crispy exterior. Stuffed with sultana and covered in cantaloupe sauce. Sides with radish puree and wild capers.\"\n    \"Hearty baking powder and pigeon stew, slow-cooked with lavender and eggplant for a comforting, flavorful meal.\"\n    \"Grilled chicken kebabs, marinated in Native American spices and served with a fresh red cabbage and nectarine salad.\"\n    \"Grilled duck kebabs, marinated in Brazilian spices and served with a fresh snowpea sprouts and avocado salad.\"\n    \"74-day aged venison steak, with choice of 4 sides.\"\n    \"Savor the rich flavors of spicy cos lettuce, complemented by plum and sweet basil.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 496\n    protein: \"16g\"\n    carbs: \"100g\"\n    fat: \"15g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
